<speak>Hello, Rachel. Yes, I am in my study, and I have put the papers on the desk. Before we get into the discussion, let me give you my identification details. My identification number is <sub alias="gee">G</sub> double nine six two five six seven <sub alias="tee">T</sub>. My date of birth is the sixteenth of May nineteen eighty. I have asked the office not to put routine calls through, although I am keeping my business messages visible. There is a supplier matter being handled by my team, and they may need a document from me.</speak>